'''Rainbow''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing it individually from the [[Rainbow Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux or from the [[Rainbow Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux during the [[Easter Event 2023|2023 Easter Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended. 

==Appearance==
The knife has a curved blade with the traditional colors of the rainbow on it: red, orange, yellow, green, blue, indigo and violet. The handle is gold and surrounding it is a white, cloud resembling guard. The cloud design is also attached to the end of the handle 

==Trivia==
*It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Rainbow Gun (Godly)|Rainbow Gun]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Rainbow Set|Rainbow Set]].
**It also partners with it’s own effect, [[Rainbow (Effect)|Rainbow]].
*This and its partner gun are the fifth gamepass weapons where you had the option to buy it as part of a bundle or separately, the others being [[Sakura]], [[Blossom]], [[Phantom]], [[Spectre]], [[Plasmablade]], [[Plasmabeam]], [[Iceflake]], and [[Icebeam]].
*[[Nikilis]] could be seen holding this knife in the lobby during the [[Easter Event 2023|2023 Easter Event]].

